  until you've approved the design.

  There's also a flag worth raising now, before it shapes the design: this app's only current input is a login form.
  Persisting preferences "across sessions" must not become a path where the username or password gets written to disk.
  I'll design the storage layer to hold only explicitly-registered preference keys, so credentials can't leak into it by
  accident.

